flowchart LR
 A[Observe need] --> B[Request verification]
 B --> C{Verified?}
 C -- No --> D[Challenge / clarify / reject]
 C -- Yes --> E[Create Action Project]
 E --> F[Match abilities & funding]
 F --> G[Deliver milestones]
 G --> H[Capture evidence]
 H --> I[Measure outcome]
 I --> J[Maintain]
 J --> K[Replicate learning]
